      "prompt": "Add alternatives for the unresolved coordination choice in `.ai/worklog/20260910_resumable-coordination/research_resumable-coordination.md`. Update that artifact only. Compare one to three meaningfully different options from safest to boldest, including value, cost, risk, and when each fits. Include a simplest-viable recommendation, but do not choose, specify, or implement.",
